    "Every name is searched together, so a fansub that uses the Chinese title and one that uses the romaji are both found.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての名前をまとめて検索するので、中国語タイトルの字幕グループもローマ字タイトルの字幕グループも見つかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有名称会一起搜索，所以用中文标题和用罗马音标题发布的字幕组都能找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every name is searched together, so a fansub that uses the Chinese title and one that uses the romaji are both found. The episode being waited for is searched by number as well.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
