    "Weekday": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曜日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What was played on each night, in order, with the encore marked — the only source that is about the concert rather than a disc of it. No song lengths, and Japanese titles come back romanised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各公演で何を演奏したか、その順番と、アンコールの区切り——ディスクではなくライブ自体を記録している唯一の情報源です。曲の長さはなく、日本語の曲名はローマ字で返ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一场演了什么、按顺序、标出安可 —— 唯一一个讲的是演唱会本身而不是它的碟片的来源。没有单曲时长，日文曲名返回的是罗马字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the episodes go": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存先"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剧集保存位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which Anime Is This?…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どの作品ですか？…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是哪部番剧？…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which anime indexes to search": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "検索するアニメのインデックス"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要搜索的动画资源站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which anime is this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どの作品ですか？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是哪部番？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without credentials the player still works — danmaku simply stays unavailable until they are configured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "認証情報がなくてもプレーヤーは使えます — 設定するまで弾幕が使えないだけです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使没有凭据，播放器也能正常使用——只是在配置好之前弹幕不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without dandanplay credentials only the Bilibili source runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "dandanplay の認証情報がない場合は Bilibili のソースだけが動きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有弹弹play 凭据时，只会使用 Bilibili 弹幕源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a rule yourself: a title to search, a fansub, a resolution": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルールを自分で作成：検索名、字幕組、解像度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自己写一条规则：搜索名称、字幕组、分辨率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You asked to keep this copy; it stays until you remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残すよう指定したキャッシュです。削除するまで残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是你要求保留的缓存，会一直保留到你移除为止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone mirrors this library and streams episodes from this Mac. Nothing is exposed to the internet: off your own network, reach this Mac through Tailscale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone はこのライブラリを同期し、この Mac からエピソードをストリーミングします。インターネットには一切公開されません。自分のネットワーク外からは Tailscale 経由で接続します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机会镜像这个媒体库，并从这台 Mac 流式播放剧集。全程不暴露到公网：不在自己的网络里时，通过 Tailscale 连到这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assrt.net API token": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "assrt.net API トークン"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "assrt.net API 令牌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "checked %@": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@にチェック"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@检查过"
          }
        }
